 "intro_zh": "钟山风景名胜区是中国著名的风景游览胜地、首批国家级风景名胜区之一。中山陵是中华民国国父、中国民主革命先行者孙中山的陵墓，主要建筑有牌坊、墓道、陵门、石阶、碑亭、祭堂和墓室等。",
 "intro_en": "The Sun Yat-sen Mausoleum (Chinese: 中山陵; pinyin: Zhōngshān Líng) is situated at the foot of the second peak of Purple Mountain in Nanjing, Jiangsu, China. Construction of the tomb started in January 1926, shortly after Sun Yat-sen's death, and was finished in spring of 1929. The architect was Lü Yanzhi, who died shortly after it was finished. His representative and project partner was his close friend Huang Tanpu.",
 "intro_en_source": "wikipedia",
